WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:05.700
This is Systems, the back office for film and TV.

2
00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:11.301
Pick your job, and the whole site changes to fit it.

3
00:00:11.551 --> 00:00:16.503
Tap Try it free. No card, no call, no download.

4
00:00:16.753 --> 00:00:22.904
As a producer, tomorrow's shoot is already here. Twenty-nine of thirty-two crew booked.

5
00:00:23.154 --> 00:00:26.503
The crew directory fills the gaps.

6
00:00:26.753 --> 00:00:32.504
Forward the award email, and your advance invoice is drafted for you.

7
00:00:32.754 --> 00:00:37.706
The call sheet is one link, with every version kept.

8
00:00:37.956 --> 00:00:44.907
On the day, tap wrap once. Everyone's overtime is worked out at their own grade.

9
00:00:45.157 --> 00:00:50.108
Timesheet and invoice arrive together. Approve both, in one tap.

10
00:00:50.358 --> 00:00:57.308
Now the crew side. Here's a gaffer's next two weeks: booked, on hold, and offered.

11
00:00:57.558 --> 00:01:00.908
An offer comes in. I'm in.

12
00:01:01.158 --> 00:01:05.710
Every job has one status, from submitted to paid.

13
00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:13.310
Overtime and timesheets are free for crew. Try it at eltio.systems.

